flowchart TD
    A[User CLI input or four example profiles] --> B[Input guardrail: validate genre, mood, energy, top-k]
    B -->|Invalid| ERR[Clear error and safe exit]
    B -->|Valid| C[Read and validate data/songs.csv]
    C -->|Missing or corrupt| ERR
    C -->|Valid catalog| D[Original recommender: genre + mood + energy scoring]
    D --> E[Sort and select initial top-k]
    E --> F{Self-check: top song mismatches both mood and energy?}
    F -->|Yes| G[One bounded retry: balanced scoring weights]
    G --> H[Re-rank actual catalog songs]
    F -->|No| H2[Keep original ranking]
    H --> I[Final match and catalog-coverage checks]
    H2 --> I
    I --> J[Ranked songs + reasons + PASS/PARTIAL/REVIEW + notes]
    J --> K[Human reviews recommendation quality]
    T[pytest: valid / conflicting / invalid / CLI cases] -.-> B
    T -.-> D
    T -.-> I